THIRD-PARTY LICENSES — communication-engine v0.2.1

The engine core (core/, channels/, watchers/ and the scripts other than the dashboard) uses only
the Python standard library. The one third-party package the code imports is Streamlit, an
optional extra for the operator dashboard (scripts/dashboard.py, scripts/dashboard_config.py,
scripts/dashboard_write.py) and the tests of those three scripts. This repository vendors and
redistributes no third-party code: the packages below are installed separately, by
`pip install streamlit==1.63.0` (the version CI pins).

Resolved by pip on 2026-11-26 for streamlit 1.63.0 on CPython 3.12 (Linux) and CPython 3.13
(macOS). Only streamlit is pinned; the other versions can move with each install.

